INSERT INTO public.llm_cache VALUES ('94bc3e8acc299c5b8ab6b977a4456e129c17bfcdfa662e904c1befff593735c6', 'obligation_verification', '{"results":[{"candidate_id":"0","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text explicitly mandates that critical security patches must be applied to all critical systems within 14 days."},{"candidate_id":"1","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text explicitly requires the RE to conduct VA/PT of all critical systems at least once a year."},{"candidate_id":"2","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text states that the RE shall conduct disaster recovery drills for critical systems at least once every six months."},{"candidate_id":"3","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text mandates that backups of critical data shall be taken daily."},{"candidate_id":"4","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text explicitly requires the restoration of backups to be tested at least once every quarter."},{"candidate_id":"5","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text explicitly requires the RE to report every cyber security incident to the Authority within six hours of detection."}]}', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', 641, 312, '2026-10-08 00:23:18.278357+00', 1, '2026-10-08 05:36:43.145851+00', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.llm_cache VALUES ('9b38f186a1ae403fc5142c6565c658b78a0aecfc099618ebcb39553a00928e08', 'obligation_extraction', '{"obligations":[{"section_id":"6.2","requirement_text":"The Regulated Entity (RE) must conduct a root cause analysis for every critical incident.","source_quote":"The RE shall conduct a root cause analysis for every critical incident","modality":"MUST","obligation_type":"INCIDENT_MANAGEMENT","subject":"The RE","action":"conduct a root cause analysis","condition":"for every critical incident","frequency_text":null,"deadline_text":null,"applicability":{"entity_types":[],"products":[],"customer_segments":[],"thresholds":[]},"responsible_function":null,"required_evidence":[{"description":"Root cause analysis report for critical incidents","evidence_type":"Report"}],"ambiguity_note":null,"self_confidence":1.0},{"section_id":"6.2","requirement_text":"The Regulated Entity (RE) must place the root cause analysis report before the Board within 30 days.","source_quote":"place the report before the Board within 30 days","modality":"MUST","obligation_type":"GOVERNANCE","subject":"The RE","action":"place the report before the Board","condition":"for every critical incident (referring to the root cause analysis report)","frequency_text":null,"deadline_text":"within 30 days","applicability":{"entity_types":[],"products":[],"customer_segments":[],"thresholds":[]},"responsible_function":null,"required_evidence":[{"description":"Board minutes documenting the presentation of the root cause analysis report","evidence_type":"Minutes"},{"description":"Root cause analysis report presented to the Board","evidence_type":"Report"}],"ambiguity_note":null,"self_confidence":1.0},{"section_id":"7.1","requirement_text":"The Regulated Entity (RE) must get an Information Systems audit conducted by an independent auditor at least once a year.","source_quote":"The RE shall get an Information Systems audit conducted by an independent auditor at least once a year","modality":"MUST","obligation_type":"TESTING_AUDIT","subject":"The RE","action":"get an Information Systems audit conducted by an independent auditor","condition":null,"frequency_text":"at least once a year","deadline_text":null,"applicability":{"entity_types":[],"products":[],"customer_segments":[],"thresholds":[]},"responsible_function":null,"required_evidence":[{"description":"Information Systems audit report","evidence_type":"Report"},{"description":"Engagement letter or contract with independent auditor","evidence_type":"Contract"}],"ambiguity_note":null,"self_confidence":1.0}]}', 'gemini#2', 'gemini-2.5-flash', 611, 998, '2026-10-08 00:23:23.959701+00', 1, '2026-10-08 05:36:43.799073+00', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.llm_cache VALUES ('730598ced618b1b34e6ea90e53920d2d1b171bcf6c2e1d7723783aca1577177f', 'obligation_verification', '{"results":[{"candidate_id":"Candidate 0","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text explicitly states that the RE shall conduct a root cause analysis for every critical incident."},{"candidate_id":"Candidate 1","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text clearly mandates that the RE must place the report before the Board within 30 days."},{"candidate_id":"Candidate 2","entailed":true,"reason":"The source text directly states that the RE shall get an Information Systems audit conducted by an independent auditor at least once a year."}]}', 'gemini', 'gemini-3.5-flash-lite', 456, 173, '2026-10-08 00:23:25.750903+00', 1, '2026-10-08 05:36:43.814877+00', NULL);
INSERT INTO public.llm_cache VALUES ('59f35da27211560ff9d92ce2b03e27fed44003420fea14161c27a23c9d1a5c8e', 'control_mapping', '{"mappings":[{"obligation_id":"51b79158-599f-4ee2-b798-f1ddf757d029","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-09","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes the meetings of an IT Strategy Committee, but the obligation requires the constitution of such a committee. The control does not address the act of forming the committee."},{"control_key":"C-IT-05","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes a disaster recovery drill and reporting to the IT Strategy Committee, which is unrelated to the obligation to constitute the committee."},{"control_key":"C-IT-10","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes an annual independent IS audit and reporting to the Audit Committee, which is unrelated to constituting an IT Strategy Committee of the Board."},{"control_key":"C-KYC-13","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes a quarterly internal audit of KYC compliance, which is unrelated to constituting an IT Strategy Committee of the Board."}]},{"obligation_id":"8fb841b8-7830-4a78-b8d6-cf667b5f5d6f","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-09","relation":"FULL","coverage":1.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":"The IT Strategy Committee of the Board meets every quarter","reason":"The control explicitly states that the IT Strategy Committee of the Board meets every quarter, which fully satisfies the obligation''s requirement to meet at least once every quarter."},{"control_key":"C-KYC-13","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes a quarterly internal audit of KYC compliance, which is unrelated to the IT Strategy Committee of the Board meeting frequency."},{"control_key":"C-IT-05","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes a disaster recovery drill and reporting to the IT Strategy Committee, which is unrelated to the IT Strategy Committee of the Board meeting frequency."},{"control_key":"C-IT-10","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes an annual independent IS audit and reporting to the Audit Committee, which is unrelated to the IT Strategy Committee of the Board meeting frequency."}]},{"obligation_id":"4462f699-5194-46f6-9fab-8d81ac7dbda0","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-KYC-02","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes the designation of a Principal Officer for AML, which is a different role than a Chief Information Security Officer (CISO) as required by the obligation."},{"control_key":"C-IT-10","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes an annual independent IS audit, which is unrelated to the obligation to appoint a Chief Information Security Officer (CISO)."},{"control_key":"C-KYC-09","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes an STR filing workflow involving a Principal Officer, which is unrelated to the obligation to appoint a Chief Information Security Officer (CISO)."},{"control_key":"C-IT-08","relation":"PARTIAL","coverage":0.8,"confidence":0.9,"control_quote":"owner: CISO","reason":"The control indicates that the CISO is the owner of the cyber incident reporting process, implying the existence and appointment of a CISO, although it does not explicitly describe the act of appointment."}]}]}', 'gemini#2', 'gemini-2.5-flash', 1248, 3823, '2026-10-08 00:23:43.78324+00', 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO public.llm_cache VALUES ('6b986f8df7724cf0958a24b3cf085d97a408a60b21d468c9220abc773b712be6', 'control_mapping', '{"mappings":[{"obligation_id":"51ee2fbd-da5d-439b-a2c7-d0286357c4a1","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-KYC-02","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control concerns the designation and communication of a Principal Officer for AML, which is unrelated to the CISO''s reporting structure."},{"control_key":"C-IT-10","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes an annual independent information systems audit and its reporting to the Audit Committee, which does not address the CISO''s direct reporting line."},{"control_key":"C-IT-08","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes the process for reporting cyber security incidents to the regulator, which is distinct from the CISO''s direct reporting relationship within the organization."},{"control_key":"C-KYC-09","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control details the workflow for filing Suspicious Transaction Reports by the Principal Officer, which is unrelated to the CISO''s reporting structure."}]},{"obligation_id":"5dc39578-c524-4911-8f73-088fd52913f2","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-01","relation":"FULL","coverage":1.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":"Privileged users of critical systems authenticate with multi-factor authentication enforced by the identity provider.","reason":"The control explicitly states that privileged users of critical systems authenticate with multi-factor authentication, directly satisfying the obligation''s requirement."},{"control_key":"C-IT-02","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes the review of user access rights, which is a different security measure than implementing multi-factor authentication."},{"control_key":"C-IT-03","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control focuses on recording and retaining logs for privileged sessions, which is distinct from implementing multi-factor authentication."},{"control_key":"C-IT-04","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes the deployment of critical security patches, which is unrelated to the implementation of multi-factor authentication."}]},{"obligation_id":"0925ab82-637f-4dfb-8303-71376e95ef1b","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-02","relation":"FULL","coverage":1.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":"Application owners review user access rights to critical systems every quarter and revoke access that is no longer required.","reason":"The control explicitly states that user access rights to critical systems are reviewed every quarter, which fully satisfies the obligation''s requirement for a review at least once every quarter."},{"control_key":"C-IT-07","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes daily data backups and quarterly restoration tests, which is unrelated to reviewing user access rights."},{"control_key":"C-IT-01","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes the implementation of multi-factor authentication for privileged users, which is distinct from reviewing user access rights."},{"control_key":"C-IT-06","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"This control describes annual vulnerability assessment and penetration testing, which is unrelated to reviewing user access rights."}]}]}', 'gemini#2', 'gemini-2.5-flash', 1256, 3358, '2026-10-08 00:23:57.393216+00', 0, NULL, NULL);
