ileged access sessions."},{"control_key":"C-IT-01","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes multi-factor authentication for privileged users, which is a different action than retaining logs of privileged access sessions."}]},{"obligation_id":"8da86d5c-a703-4b15-9dce-037f6f00c43b","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-04","relation":"PARTIAL","coverage":0.5,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":"Critical security patches are deployed to critical systems within 30 days of release","reason":"The control applies critical security patches to critical systems, but the deadline of 30 days is longer than the required 14 days."},{"control_key":"C-IT-01","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes multi-factor authentication, which is a different action than applying critical security patches."},{"control_key":"C-IT-02","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes reviewing user access rights, which is a different action than applying critical security patches."},{"control_key":"C-IT-03","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes logging privileged sessions, which is a different action than applying critical security patches."}]}]}', 'gemini#2', 'gemini-2.5-flash', 1253, 3308, '2026-10-08 00:24:11.995744+00', 0, NULL, NULL);
