cting disaster recovery drills."},{"control_key":"C-IT-04","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes patch management, which is a different action from conducting disaster recovery drills."},{"control_key":"C-IT-02","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes quarterly user access reviews, which is a different action from conducting disaster recovery drills."}]},{"obligation_id":"bd7b964b-7a7d-4b9b-85ed-10fdf9b26ab9","judgements":[{"control_key":"C-IT-07","relation":"FULL","coverage":1.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":"Critical data is backed up daily","reason":"The control explicitly states that critical data is backed up daily, matching both the action, scope, and frequency of the obligation."},{"control_key":"C-IT-01","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes multi-factor authentication for privileged users, which is a different action from taking backups of critical data."},{"control_key":"C-IT-04","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes patch management, which is a different action from taking backups of critical data."},{"control_key":"C-IT-03","relation":"NONE","coverage":0.0,"confidence":1.0,"control_quote":null,"reason":"The control describes privileged session logging, which is a different action from taking backups of critical data."}]}]}', 'gemini#2', 'gemini-2.5-flash', 1259, 3253, '2026-10-08 00:24:26.178147+00', 0, NULL, NULL);
